      "title": "Q1",
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Rate-limit checks and statistics reads can interleave. Explain what in your implementation makes each decision and its counter updates atomic, so that every (client, endpoint) state and the aggregate statistics stay consistent; what this approach costs as traffic grows and how you would reduce that cost; and what would change if several server processes on the same machine enforced the same limits.",
        "zh-cn": "限流检查与统计读取可能交错执行。说明在你的实现中，是什么让每次决策及其计数更新成为原子操作，从而使每个 (client, endpoint) 的状态和聚合统计保持一致；随着流量增长，这种做法的代价是什么，你会如何降低它；如果同一台机器上的多个服务器进程执行同一组限额，又会有什么变化。"
